<section class="section-block">
	<h2>Limits of this design</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>The keys are sent blind.</strong> <code>sendDigits</code> follows its timing, not what the other system says. If that system changes its greeting or menu, update the pauses and keys.</li>
		<li><strong>The line test runs until the caller hangs up.</strong> <code>&lt;Echo&gt;</code> has no time limit and no way to continue to another verb.</li>
		<li><strong>One fixed extension.</strong> To let callers choose, give each key its own <code>&lt;Number sendDigits&gt;</code>.</li>
	</ul>
</section>

